    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nOPEN VIEWING SATURDAY 03RD OCTOBER 2026 - 12.30PM TO 1PM\n\nSherry FitzGerald are delighted to present 15 Thornleigh Road to the market. This well-presented family home enjoys a convenient location in the heart of Applewood, within easy reach of a host of shops, schools, leisure facilities and transport links.\n\nAccommodation comprises an inviting entrance hall, spacious lounge, and bright open-plan kitchen/dining area with ample space for everyday family living and entertaining. Upstairs there are well proportioned bedrooms and family bathroom, offering comfortable accommodation throughout. All windows and back door have been recently replaced to triple glazed.\n\nTo the rear is a private walled garden with a lawned area and patio space, providing an ideal setting for outdoor dining and relaxation.\n\nThornleigh Road is ideally located within walking distance of Applewood Village, Swords Main Street, the Pavilions Shopping Centre and Airside Retail Park. Dublin Airport, the M50 and M1 motorways are all easily accessible, making this an excellent choice for commuters. \n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 2.20m x 2.50m\nWelcoming hallway.\n\nKitchen - 2.80m x 2.40m\nFitted kitchen with ample range of wall and floor units, worktops, tiled splashback, integrated oven, hob and extractor fan.\n\nLounge - 5.70m x 4.20m\nSpacious lounge with fireplace and gas fire insert. Double sliding doors lead onto rear garden. Separate storage room.\n\nUPSTAIRS - \n\n\nLanding - 5.40m x 2.0m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.0m x 2.50m\nDouble bedroom with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.20m x 2.50m\nBuilt in wardrobes, carpet flooring.\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.30m x 1.70m\nFamily bathroom comprising bath with shower off, Wc, wash hand basin, fully tiled walls and floor.\n\nStairs to Second Floor - \n\n\nMain Bedroom - 4.60m x 3.0m\nTop floor bedroom with walk in wardrobe, Velux windows and en suite.\n\nEn Suite - 2.40m x 1.80m\nComprising shower, Wc, wash hand basin. Tiled walls, wood flooring.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Mid terrace family residence</li><li>Mature and sought after location</li><li>Bright Accommodation</li><li>Spacious lounge</li><li>Modern fitted kitchen</li><li>Three bedrooms</li><li>Main bedroom with walk in wardrobe and en suite</li><li>Gas fired central heating</li><li>Newly installed triple glazed windows and back door</li><li>South facing rear garden</li><li>Convenient to Swords and all local amenities</li><li>Convenient to Applewood Village and a host of leisure, shopping and transport amenities</ul>"
      },
